WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:09.980
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan</b>

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:04.480
Man, the year's already over, huh?

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.550
That was fast.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.070
Really sucks, doesn't it?

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.980
The years pass faster as we get older.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:17.450
At this rate, will the years 
be passing at Formula 1 speeds

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.410
when I'm an old geezer?

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.200
I've still got a long ways to go.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:29.480
Well, I'm already up to Ben 
Johnson speed, I'd say.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.120
Cause my Ben can't keep up.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.750
Don't get too cocky because 
you're all still young.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.090
Your Ben will fall 
behind soon enough.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.540
For real?

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.000
Ben?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.080
I prefer Carl (Lewis) over Ben.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.300
He's cooler.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.200
Whatever.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.670
Didn't we have a good time this year?

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.490
Hell no!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:55.780
This is the worst time to be reusing 
this segment for the fifth time!

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.030
You have a point.

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.770
Good evening.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.430
I'm Gintoki Sakata.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.430
I'm Shinpachi Shimura.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.180
I'm Kagura.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:02.390
I'm sure some of you are already aware

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:07.190
that this will be the final 
episode of the Gintama anime.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.060
It's been six years since 
the show first began.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:14.310
After numerous accidents, 
complaints, fake endings,

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.200
plenty of toilet humor, and censorship...

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:20.220
After surviving multiple 
fatal blunders, this show is

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.210
finally coming to an end.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:25.040
So we did some brainstorming...

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.710
...to decide how we should end this show!

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.720
Here is our answer!

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:37.720
<b>We're Sorry</b>

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.820
So, like the episode title says,

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.260
we will be using this episode

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:47.300
as an opportunity to apologize

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.240
to everyone this show may have offended.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:53.110
Such as Capcom, who laughed it off;

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:55.670
Mr. Miyazaki, who didn't even notice;

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.240
and ex-producer Azuma who 
moved onto a stress free role.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.730
There were also many other 
staff who were affected.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:05.840
Such as Sket Dance, which 
pulled some weird stuff

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.370
and *****-san.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:14.260
<b>We're sorry.
Sob...</b>

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.960
And most importantly, our viewers.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:12.770
We're very sorry!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:16.260
Well, Shinpachi.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.030
Time to commit seppuku.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.290
You're dressed in white 
so you're ready to die.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.350
Why only me?!

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.270
We're all dressed in white!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.170
What's wrong?

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.200
It's time for you to take responsibility

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.580
for turning the eighth 
episode of the second series

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.090
into a weak recap episode!

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:32.330
How is that my fault?!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.780
People want to see major characters 
die in the last episode.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.240
It's standard practice.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.020
You need to die to make 
this show legendary.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.460
Are you telling me to 
throw my life away?!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.280
And there wouldn't be 
any drama if I died now!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.210
I would die for nothing!

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.770
Don't worry. If it doesn't work,

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:47.930
we'll bring you back to life 
like those other shows did.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.920
We just started apologizing and 
we're already offending more people!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.430
Oh, that's right.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.430
There's something we 
forgot to apologize for.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:58.470
Well, I'm sure everybody's 
figured it out,

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.800
but we won't be showing the story 
that was in last week's preview.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.570
We wanted to, but there wasn't any time.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.380
I guess we got your hopes up for nothing.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.440
We're sorry!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.440
You did it on purpose!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:12.940
Shut up!

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.310
Stupid!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:18.070
You actually thought the staff members 
could handle two long arcs in a row?!

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:18.920
Don't overestimate them!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.430
Yeah! And we already 
apologized last week!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.450
When did you do that?!

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.780
Are you blind?

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.290
Look at his lips move.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.800
<b>We're sorry.</b>

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:31.440
Who would get that?!

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:32.800
That's just plain evil!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:35.910
And you guys aren't even 
sincere about apologizing!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.330
That's not true.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.300
Don't get too worked up.

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.010
We'll take over from here.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.310
The Shinsengumi members!

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:47.620
If you need some apologizing 
done, we got Hijikata,

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.460
the master of cleaning up messes.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.450
Hold on.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.280
Why do I have to clean up their mess?

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.310
Hey, Yamazaki. Since 
you're dressed in white,

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:56.780
you might as well disembowel yourself.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:57.770
Or else I'll kill you.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.260
Huh?! Why me?!

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.720
And all I did this time around was 
say anpan over and over again!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.590
I didn't do anything to offend anyone!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.580
Hijikata-san, in that case, I also...

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.580
I'll jam it right up your ***.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.720
...did nothing to offend anyone.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:16.210
That's bullshit! You've offended 
everyone under the sun!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.650
It's the last episode, 
so stop fighting, boys!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.590
Kondo-san...

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:23.840
I'll apologize for the Shinsengumi.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:29.610
I'll lay myself bare and apologize 
for all the trouble we've caused.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:31.550
We're sorry.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.550
You're literally bare now!

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:35.610
You were planning on doing 
this from the start!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.140
Hey, gorilla.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:41.140
Considering everything you've done, 
an ordinary apology won't cut it!

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.620
What's ordinary about 
stripping buck naked?!

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:46.560
For the last episode, you have to 
reveal more than before and apologize!

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.370
What's left to reveal?

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:49.260
Your ass hair.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.130
What?!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.130
You're very perceptive, big guy.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.480
Okay, let's shave it all off!

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.380
S-Stop it!

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.590
And you need to humiliate 
yourself when you apologize.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.980
Prostrating yourself isn't enough.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:00.610
You must be joking!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:02.640
Chief, can I stick anpan here?

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:10.160
And so, I would like to 
lay myself completely bare

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.540
and apologize for everything 
we may have done.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.330
We're sorry!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.580
One more time!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.140
We're sorry!

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:20.030
One more time.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:20.870
We're sorry!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.580
One more time!

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.570
We're sorry! We're sorry!

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.070
One more time.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.930
Cut it out!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.520
I'm really sorry about this!

00:07:31.920 --> 00:08:07.330
<b>Apologize to the camera!!</b>

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.540
I've been hiding here for six years

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.760
while watching Gin-san *** and ***!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.550
I'm sorry for being such 
a naughty girl, Bolshoi!

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.550
I'm sorry for being a naughty girl

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.740
who gets drunk in the middle of 
the day and embarrasses herself.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.190
Just kidding, stupid!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.940
I need booze to get me 
through this final episode!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:00.900
I'm sorry for being a naughty boy 
who needs kinky play to get it up!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.790
Wait up!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:04.820
Pay up!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:07.320
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.700
<b>Gintama
Confessional</b>

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:16.640
Come in, sinful lambs. Make it quick.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:23.150
You failed to properly apologize 
at the beginning of the show.

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:25.300
Now repent.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.900
I'll go first.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:31.350
Dear Lord, I'm supposed 
to be the cute heroine,

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.770
but I'm always throwing up.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.840
I'm sorry...

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:40.190
She threw up before God!

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.680
The memories made me throw up.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.320
Well, God can see everything inside me,

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:46.860
so I spilled everything.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.700
Uh, you're not supposed to 
actually spill your guts.

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.620
Are you done repenting?

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:53.100
It smells bad, so let's stop.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:58.090
No, we haven't been throwing up for 
years without learning anything.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.620
There is a way to counter barf.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.060
Really? But it's the last episode.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:03.670
Shut up!

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.970
Behold the results of our attempts 
to continuously improve!

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.650
Kagura, it's not your 
fault for throwing up.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.550
It's a bodily process.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:12.730
Like when you suddenly get hard in class.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:13.980
So the key is what you 
do after you get hard.

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:17.440
So after I throw up, I 
should use weird light

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.690
to cover it up like those other shows do?

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.090
Uh, what is this image?!

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.310
It's disgusting!

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.280
And why are you covering 
Hedoro-san's chest?!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.360
That's not needed!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:27.010
Hide. That's certainly an option.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:28.710
But when it comes to barf...

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:32.950
Oh, sound effects!

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.460
You can use sound effects to cover it up!

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.310
I'll give it a try!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.430
Shit, watching them throw 
up makes me want to...

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:04.530
Cut it out! You're standing before God!

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:07.220
Wait, you still want us to repent?

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.530
You bet!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:09.600
Look!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.360
This geezer's sick of 
standing in the same pose!

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.540
He's gonna die! Hurry up!

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:18.540
We've been throwing up the entire show.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:21.000
We're sorry!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:22.540
Now pray.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:11:04.960
<b>Apologize to the camera!!</b>

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:45.800
Nobody cares that I want to 
restore our father's dojo now.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.370
I'm sorry for ever mentioning it.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.080
I'm sorry for climaxing-ray!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:58.080
I'm sorry for sending a 
person to the afterlife.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.960
I-I'm sorry...

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:11.150
I present the Joi Apology Seminar for 
the shy person who doesn't how to apologize!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:19.390
<b>Applause
Cheers!!</b>

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.830
What is this?

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:16.850
As a refined warrior, I believe 
I should teach everyone

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.390
the proper way to apologize.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.400
I see. That'll really help!

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:27.580
First, I'll teach you how to 
make stubborn men apologize.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.640
Oh, it's Smile.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:31.910
Are you saying that they 
should use alcohol?

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.300
Welcome.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:34.450
You look so young.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.170
How old are you?

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.130
Let's say that I'm in my late twenties.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:43.100
You should never answer, 
"How old do I look?"

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.950
That's the reply most customers will use,

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.690
so the escorts are sick of hearing it.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:49.410
Uh, did we need that explanation?

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.130
This is turning into a 
hostess club seminar.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.430
Oh, forgive me.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.990
I forgot to introduce myself.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.040
My name is Tae.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.350
O-Oh.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.490
It's bad manners to ask 
for her e-mail address or

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:01.970
phone number at this point.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:03.900
Wait until she's about to leave.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.470
We don't need that information!

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:07.940
And my sister already apologized first!

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.860
Oh, no!

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:14.570
Did I get your clothes wet? Are you okay?

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.930
Oh, here we go.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.860
You finally get a chance to apologize.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:16.690
No.

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:17.370
Huh?

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:18.870
Hey!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.140
These glasses are hard to hold.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:22.620
I'm very sorry!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.410
Huh? You aren't going to apologize?

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:26.380
And you're a pretty nasty customer.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.930
Sorry, I'll make you a new 
one, so please wait...

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.720
Excuse me, would you like a smoke?

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:35.980
Sorry, I don't smoke.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:38.430
That wasn't an apology!

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:41.000
And it didn't even make sense!

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.780
I-I'm sorry...

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:48.610
<b>That made sense!</b>

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.090
That's the punch line?!

00:12:48.610 --> 00:13:13.760
<b>Apologize to the camera!!</b>

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.370
I was too late for Ryomaden and Jin,

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.400
but at least I didn't miss 
the Year of the Dragon!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:56.730
And wait, Zuraki-san!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:58.780
How could you go to Smile without me?!

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.540
I'm sorry Oryo-chan.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.960
I promise to visit this year!

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.630
What? Apologize?

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:07.960
Are you talking to me?

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.890
I who only appeared in one episode 
in the second series?

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:13.720
I'll kill you.

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:16.720
Don't be sad because 
it's the last episode!

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:19.720
You still have We are Old TamaCure!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.310
Empty Smile Ultra Peace!

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:35.700
<b>Apologize to the camera!!</b>

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:28.730
I'm sorry for offending so many 
people in a matter of seconds.

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:35.700
I'm sorry.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.390
This is great, Shinsuke-sama!

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.280
We made it in time!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.890
It seems that they want us to apologize.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.670
I believe we should do 
as they want this time.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.140
Well, I understand how you feel!

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:01.740
I understand how you feel, but we 
barely get any screen time as it is!

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:06.730
The Kiheitai episode was a little bloody.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.990
I'm sorry.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.250
I shouldn't be so violent.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:20.290
But I really want to destroy...

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:25.700
...the Greater Edo Ordinance Regarding 
the Healthy Development of Youths!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.420
This turned into a 
typical random episode.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.610
We got all these people here and 
we still can't make it work?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.660
Are you zeros?

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.990
Total zeros?

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.930
Are you going to spend the 
rest of your lives as zeros?

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:44.480
Kagura-chan, don't say that.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.770
We're trying the best we can!

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:50.080
Exactly! Tell it like it is, Gin-san!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:52.440
It's been a mess, but 
we've been apologizing!

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:54.030
What are you talking about?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.280
We haven't done any apologizing. 
The producers have...

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.100
Hey! Stop talking!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.690
That's a delicate issue!

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.450
It's gotten pretty touchy!

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.920
Think about it, Kagura.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:09.560
We've done some stupid things, 
but we've always apologized.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.960
Really?

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.190
Sure!

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.460
Let's look back!

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.090
I-I'm sorry.

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.970
We're sorry! We're really sorry!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.210
We'll lick your boots, so forgive us!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.510
Sorry about that.

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:25.970
I got too cocky.

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:26.890
I'm sorry!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.560
I'm very sorry.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.560
Sorry...

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:31.520
Sorry.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.340
Sorry.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.320
Please forgive me.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.780
Teehee, I got caught.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.440
Sorry!

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.590
I'm sorry!

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.840
I'm sorry!

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.500
Please! Please spare my life!

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.750
Sorry. Bye.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.250
We're sorry!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.520
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.460
I'm sorry!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:56.440
My bad.

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:57.460
Oh. Sorry.

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:58.090
I'm sorry!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.210
I'm terribly sorry.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:15:59.880
Sorry.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:00.840
Yeah, sorry about that.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.090
Sorry.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:03.090
I'm sorry.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.430
We deeply apologize.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.390
Oh, we've done more 
apologizing than I realized.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.420
No idea who we were apologizing to, though.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:21.320
Yeah, everybody's forgotten that 
we can be serious at times.

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:25.830
I'm sure you've all forgotten 
my touching apology.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.910
Touching apology?

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.100
Yes, my touching apology!

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:36.230
Damn old man!

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.460
Kid!

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:47.430
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.330
No, I'm the one who's sorry.

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.920
I will keep my promise and survive.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.040
In return...

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:04.210
You will keep your promise and...

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.820
No, first...

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.330
I'm sorry.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:10.580
Right?

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.590
The hell are you on?!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.540
That never happened!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.460
Don't start rewriting history!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.670
You ruined a good scene! Don't 
put words in Jirocho's mouth!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.640
I guess this is it.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.670
I'm surprised they even lasted this long.

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:25.650
Let's go drink.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:26.770
Without Hijikata-san.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:27.560
Eh?!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.430
Tae-chan, please come drink at my place.

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:31.340
Oh, that's a good idea.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:33.400
Yay! Free food!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:37.150
Lady! I already booked us at ***!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.920
Tama, if Gintoki drinks himself 
cold, take all his possessions.

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:42.560
Understood, Lady Otose.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.190
We won't leave a single ass hair.

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:46.810
Hey! Gin-san's ass hair is mine!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.700
What are you fighting about? Foolishness.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.200
I guess I'll go home and 
take a Joi by myself.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.500
Don't you mean, take a bath?!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.210
And you realize that you're 
surrounded by cops!

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.220
Zaki, that's enough for today.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:17:59.670
Huh?

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:03.390
We should go drink instead of wasting 
our time on this Odd Jobs mess.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.170
That's true.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.170
Well, let's call it a wrap.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:11.670
Huh?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.180
Th-That's...

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:18.600
The gorilla author!

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:19.690
<b>Me</b>

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.240
That stinks!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.350
What is this?

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.550
It looks like a letter.

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:33.670
Kagura, you don't have to stay in 
character, so read this letter.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.960
Okay.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.560
We would like to thank everyone

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:44.530
who has supported the Gintama 
anime this entire time.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:50.640
This show will be ending for now,

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:54.390
but it has nothing to do with

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.340
any trouble we may have caused.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:59.170
And it has nothing to 
do with the fact that

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:05.160
the animation staff faithfully 
adapted every dirty joke.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:10.730
And it has nothing to do with the fact 
that I can no longer eat fried chicken.

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:17.200
And it has nothing to do with the fact 
that director Fuji** got divorced.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.400
There was never any internal strife.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:24.470
The only strife was in 
director Fuji**'s household.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:30.350
If you want a reason, it's because the 
producer suddenly shaved his head,

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.510
so we could no longer sacrifice 
his hair as a way to apologize

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.810
when something went wrong.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:38.060
So you don't need to be sad.

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:41.450
We promise that when 
his hair is long enough

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.300
for him to be frequenting 
hostess clubs again,

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:50.650
we'll return and shave his head again.

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:54.390
So wipe away those tears. Cheer up.

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:59.480
We ask someone out there to send director 
Fuji** arranged marriage proposals.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.350
This isn't the end.

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:05.810
So we don't intend to say goodbye.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:09.340
There's only one thing for us to say.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:11.830
We're sorry!

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:15.210
If we ever meet again, 
we'll have reflected

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:18.450
upon our behavior and cleaned up our act,

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.640
to bring you a powered-up Gintama.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:24.660
That's what it will take.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.860
On behalf of the Gintama 
staff, I promise you this.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.080
No matter what happens,

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:34.110
the Gintama staff and Gintama

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:36.270
will never give up (on dirty jokes)!

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.380
I want to be a cheese steamed bun!

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:46.620
Gin-san, the gorilla left.

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:48.880
Should we beat him up later?

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:52.960
Stupid.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.880
You should know the answer.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:56.790
We just kind of popped back up,

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:57.890
so when it's time to close down,

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.200
we'll pop out!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.270
Yeah!

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:02.890
So long, everyone!

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:09.940
Sorry that we'll never 
give up (on dirty jokes)!
